# a scene's knobs: FX steps the pages (the scene's, MIX, MORE); the levels move; the knobs are saved by themselves a few seconds
# after the last turn (behind a dip in the level), and are as they were after a reboot
# (ZEN-1 boots into the scene)
wait 800
wait 2000
expect knob1 25
expect knob6 30
wait 100
shot mix-page.png
tap FX
tap FX
spin K3 -20
spin K1 -10
wait 100
expect knob6 10
expect knob4 70
# Music: Echo
wait 100
shot more-page.png
tap FX
tap FX
spin K1 -40
expect knob10 0
# Nature: Air Type and Water Type, under their levels
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
# Water is: Brook by default (1); Bubbles (0) to the left, White noise (2) to the right; Air is: Soft (0)
expect knob9 1
expect knob8 0
spin K4 -1
expect knob9 0
shot more-bubbles.png
spin K3 2
expect knob8 3
# switching Water back and forth (comparing the streams) never pauses the sound: the saves go to the journal
# 20 s after the last change, with no sector erase (store_writes stays 0)
wait 3000
spin K4 1
wait 3000
spin K4 1
expect knob9 2
wait 15000
expect dirty 1
wait 7000
expect dirty 0
expect store_writes 0
# FX, after the bar has gone: the scene's page
tap FX
spin K2 20
expect knob1 45
wait 15000
expect dirty 1
wait 7000
expect dirty 0
expect store_writes 0
reboot
wait 1500
expect mode 1
expect knob1 45
expect knob4 70
expect knob6 10
expect knob10 0
